## 📜 최종 소스코드

```js
function solution(arr) {
    const answer = [0,0];
    function recur(x,y,length){
        let val=arr[y][x];
        for(let i=y;i<y+length;i++){
            for(let j=x;j<x+length;j++){
                if(arr[i][j]!==val){
                    recur(x,y,length/2);
                    recur(x+length/2,y,length/2);
                    recur(x,y+length/2,length/2);
                    recur(x+length/2,y+length/2,length/2);
                    return;
                }
            }
        }
    
        answer[val]+=1;
    }
    recur(0,0,arr.length);
    return answer;
}
```

A first draft of the web files.

Created multiple pages (*.html), a stylesheet (index.css) and a script (index.js).

Pages were created for:
1. Content display (index.html);
2. Error display (error-pages/*.html);
3. Test redirects (redirects/*.html);
4. Test post/delete requests (form*.html).

A cgi folder was added (cgi-bin) to host our cgi scripts. Empty for now.

While the server is not working, `http-server` is a great tool to test this pages visually (does not work for CGI testing).
